# Copy to .env.local (ignored by git) for local development.
# In GitHub Actions these come from the repository's Actions secrets of the same names.
# Both values are public by design (they ship to every browser); row-level security protects the data.
# Never put the Supabase secret key (sb_secret_...) here or anywhere in the app.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=
